  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe Cyberspace for digital Bangladesh: Developing National &amp; Regional Cyber Investigation and Digital Forensics facilities for Bangladesh Police</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Constructing five storey building at Chattogram, supply of tools and equipment for CID Dhaka, Chattogram, Coxs Bazar, Training program design,  Cybercrime investigation and digital forensic lecture, Invitational and local training</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objectives are to strengthen the digital investigation capabilities of the criminal investigation department of Bangladesh Police to effectively combat emerging cybercrime &amp; conventional crimes all over Bangladesh and to enhance evidence-based policing in Bangladesh by providing sound digital forensic services in all relevant cases and by implementation of competency-based human resource management.&#xbc29;&#xae00;&#xb77c;&#xb370;&#xc2dc; &#xacbd;&#xcc30;&#xccad;&#xc758; &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138;&#xc218;&#xc0ac;&#xb2a5;&#xb825; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
  </description>
